{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2019-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1557273600, "end_date": 1557964799, "month_true_total": 1429, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:41:40 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50663609", "author": {"steamid": "76561198369252467", "personaname": "MyntiBeast", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ultralightbeasts/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2493, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 373, "last_played": 1704018604, "avatar": "1bb639cddcdc50dc12fcbc6a02e628c52e8ec744"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like what I've seen and played for an early access title, and I'm excited to see what more will be coming in the future. Good on you, Hopoo Games. :3", "timestamp_created": 1557961843, "timestamp_updated": 1557961843, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520905971527099609", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50663474", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990138226", "personaname": "TimeLess <RIP T2>", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1337822/", "num_games_owned": 450, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 3782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 163, "last_played": 1768369178, "avatar": "f535384e5389bd418546f22ae96340df1702971f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Edit: This has been fixed and the game is great, disregard any and everything below this point, hell go out and buy the expansion too.\n\nHello all, so i will start first with i love this game. Its a great action-rogue like shooter. Reminds me of the old contra with the power up system and keeps stacking and stacking. I can see this becoming a little monotonous in the future but that happens with all games.\n\nNow, the reason why i gave this a thumbs down. \n\nI haven't seen anyone talk about this issue with the game so i will put it out there. There is an issue with the game deleting your profiles upon exiting. Yes, this means that your entire game profile for RoR2 is gone(Characters, milestones). With this bug still affecting many people i can't recommend it. 25$ to keep starting a game over which is dependent upon progression.\n\nWhen this gets fixed i will give this a thumbs up rating. Until then i cannot , in confidence, recommend this.", "timestamp_created": 1557960823, "timestamp_updated": 1660180068, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.435399264097213745", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50663411", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207577664", "personaname": "CasperWantsKFC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207577664/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1043, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 264, "last_played": 1627368040, "avatar": "4522ca1f087df7c0abf52b65b227ca96a1d3444b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't normally write reviews but ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥...", "timestamp_created": 1557960345, "timestamp_updated": 1557960345, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50663297", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133852334", "personaname": "NoLieNoahXP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NoLieNoahXP/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1719, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1348, "last_played": 1700023766, "avatar": "e954d9a2ed7de4d64cd612dda2ccbc68dd6b56d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game you can always play with friends or by yourself. Originally I didn't think i would play the game repetitively, but the randomness and rng of items you can receive is by far one of the best things in the game. From black hole to kamehameha this game will also be just dumb fun for you and your friends. Also waiting for updates on new characters since all of them are so unique I really can't wait to see what they make next.", "timestamp_created": 1557959504, "timestamp_updated": 1557959504, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50663258", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047416220", "personaname": "daswiftguy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/daswiftguy/", "num_games_owned": 370, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 4115, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1139, "last_played": 1695685515, "avatar": "6b584a9c8bd86a763e67410d77840dff104cd97d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like this game, lots of fun both playing single player or with friends. Looks like they also have a good plan for updates as well. I suggest you give it a try", "timestamp_created": 1557959174, "timestamp_updated": 1557959174, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_de